# The integration image is built from a tar on stdin; node_modules would make
# that context enormous and is never needed there. The images that carry the
# interface build it from web/ in a Node stage, which runs its own `npm ci`.
# web/dist is a local build, and the stage makes its own.
.git
node_modules
web/node_modules
web/dist
# The repo-root build output.
/dist

# The bake definition and the compose files describe how to build; they are
# never inputs to a build.
/docker-bake.hcl
/deploy/*/docker-compose.yaml
